    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1cf972b367a2b1d27edbab4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当时我没跟她说，其实我是在确认\n训练地点附近哪里有信号。\n我想说为了以防万一，有必要先确认好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "530c8d1e684b9ba5a826e0f90d581c2ff51000c1e3b0f54777dd85ad1a44b7e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036515.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2a96eada00fff120191c93d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那时候我在山脊线和开阔的地方\n曾经捕捉到几次信号。\n而刚才我发现的地方，离有信号的位置很近。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a455ab134ec09d2e19f903e46c178af91e1217cff46e58aaff731da5add17369",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036515.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dde3da9d0f1126f5796023ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你在这里等我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "959a5f9ffcdc29fda2b6ff15d725df5eec20be617038e34229a342dc688c4b6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036515.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c77dba653c5aa08387c6c95",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "考量到信号通常是往下发射，\n那么或许有机会捕捉到一丁点信号！\n虽然可能得冒着风险走在没有路的地方，但是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bb247dc6cd4446a1787e4ebf458223069c88dec90c7c41378d29cd5d416341b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036515.json",
      "json_path": [
